 errors into the appropriate Apple Pay error, for use in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PKPaymentAuthorizationResult"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If the error can be fixed by the customer within the Apple Pay sheet, we return an NSError that can be displayed in the Apple Pay sheet.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise, the original error is returned, resulting in the Apple Pay sheet being dismissed. You should display the error message to the customer afterwards.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Currently, we convert billing address related errors into a PKPaymentError that helpfully points to the billing address field in the Apple Pay sheet.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Note that Apple Pay should prevent most card errors (e.g. invalid CVC, expired cards) when you add a card to the wallet.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.stripe.stripe-apple-pay\/documentation\/StripeApplePay","doc:\/\/com.stripe.stripe-apple-pay\/documentation\/StripeApplePay\/StripeCore","doc:\/\/com.stripe.stripe-apple-pay\/documentation\/StripeApplePay\/StripeCore\/STPAPIClient"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/stripeapplepay\/stripecore\/stpapiclient\/pkpaymenterror(forstripeerror:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.stripe.stripe-apple-pay/documentation/StripeApplePay/StripeCore/STPAPIClient/pkPaymentError(forStripeError:)":{"title":"pkPaymentError(forStripeError:)","url":"\/documentation\/stripeapplepay\/stripecore\/stpapiclient\/pkpaymenterror(forstripeerror:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.stripe.stripe-apple-pay\/documentation\/StripeApplePay\/StripeCore\/STPAPIClient\/pkPaymentError(forStripeError:)","abstract":[{"text":"Converts Stripe errors into the appropriate Apple Pay error, for use in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"